  "description": "The native payload for Agora's AI acoustic echo cancellation extension (aiaec 4.6.3 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. Cancels the far end leaking back through the local speaker in cases the conventional AEC cannot handle — cheap speakers, high volume, a device held close to another. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.SetParameters(\"{\\\"che.audio.aiaec.working_mode\\\": 1}\") in the RTC binding.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
